    learningObjectives: ['Identify properties of various four-sided shapes', 'Distinguish between rectangles, rhombuses, and squares', 'Understand the hierarchy of quadrilaterals'],
    richContent: "<article><h1 style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.2;\">Quadrilaterals: The Logic of Four-Sided Shapes</h1><p style=\"font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.6;\">Explore the diverse world of 4-sided geometry with our 'Classifying Quadrilaterals' worksheets. Help students navigate the complex hierarchy of rhombuses, trapezoids, and parallelograms using rigorous property-based logic. Free PDF for grades 3-5.</p><section style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">The Hierarchy of Shapes</h2><p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Why is a square always a rectangle, but a rectangle isn't always a square? Our worksheets challenge students to move beyond simple naming to explore the <strong>defining properties</strong> of polygons. By analyzing side lengths, parallel pairs, and internal angles, children build the <strong>deductive reasoning</strong> skills essential for advanced geometry and proof-based mathematics. This conceptual mastery helps students categorize the world with scientific accuracy.</p></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Key Geometry Milestones</h2><ul style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1.5rem;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Parallelism Identification:</strong> Spotting pairs of sides that will never cross.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\"><strong>Vertex Analysis:</strong> Measuring right angles to distinguish between rhombuses and squares.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Hierarchical Logic:</strong> Understanding the inclusive nature of shape families.</li></ul></section><section><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Premier Academic Geometry PDFs</h2><p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;\">Wizqo produces high-resolution educational resources that are free and instantly accessible. Our geometry sheets follow standard pediatric learning trajectories and are distraction-free to encourage deep focus. Every download includes a clear answer key for classroom or home use. Download your quadrilateral guide today!</p></section></article>"
