    richContent: "<article><h1 style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.2;\">Numeracy in Letters: The Teen Number Words</h1><p style=\"font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.6;\">Conquer the tricky spelling of larger numbers with our 'Number Words 11-20' worksheets. Designed for Grades 1 and 2, these activities help children bridge the word-math gap for 'elevens' and 'twelves', building the <strong>linguistic stamina</strong> needed for advanced word problems. Free PDF download for fluent readers.</p><section style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Mastering the Tricky Teens</h2><p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">'Eleven' and 'Twelve' don't follow the rules! Our worksheets help students master these <strong>irregular spellings</strong> and the 'teen' suffixes. By matching digits like '13' to 'thirteen,' children build <strong>decoding precision</strong> and <strong>academic vocabulary</strong>. This practice is the essential precursor to independent story writing and understanding multi-step math problems. It helps children see the logical - and sometimes quirky - patterns of math language, increasing their confidence in integrated literacy blocks. This is the <strong>symbolic foundation</strong> of intermediate math communication and reading comprehension. A must-have for every Grade 1-2 classroom.</p></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Literacy Mastery Goals</h2><ul style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1.5rem;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Irregular Spelling:</strong> memorizing the unique spelling of 11 and 12.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Pattern Awareness:</strong> recognizing the 'teen' suffix in words 13-19.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Fluency:</strong> reading and writing teen names with speed and accuracy.</li></ul></section><section><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Premier Academic Grade Printables</h2><p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;\">Wizqo produces educator-vetted resources that are free and instantly accessible. Our number-word sheets are high-resolution for crisp, clear visual study and follow standard pedagogical development paths for primary education. Every download includes a clear answer key. Spell your tens today!</p></section></article>"
