    learningObjectives: ['Recognize common Kindergarten sight words in context', 'Decode simple CVC words to read short, repetitive sentences', 'Demonstrate basic understanding by matching text to images'],
    richContent: "<article><h1 style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.2;\">Ready to Read: Kindergarten Literacy Foundations</h1><p style=\"font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.6;\">Embark on the journey of reading with our 'Kindergarten Reading Readiness' worksheets. Designed for first-time decoders, these activities focus on <strong>sight words and CVC blending</strong>, building the self-confidence needed for school success. Free PDF download for early learners.</p><section style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">The Joy of First Sentences</h2><p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">I can read! Our worksheets help students move beyond simple letters to <strong>functional story-reading</strong>. By combining high-frequency sight words with predictable phonics patterns, children build <strong>decoding automaticity</strong> and <strong>reading joy</strong>. This practice is the essential precursor to independent literature and becoming a lifelong learner. It helps children see that words share meaning and tell stories, turning the page into a window of discovery. This is the <strong>symbolic foundation</strong> of literacy and academic pride. A bright, engaging start to early childhood reading centers.</p></section><section style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Early Literacy Milestones</h2><ul style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1.5rem;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Sight Word recognition:</strong> identifying words like 'the', 'is', and 'my' on sight.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Predictable Blending:</strong> reading repetitive CVC sentences with zero errors.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><strong>Meaning Matching:</strong> Connecting a sentence to its correct visual image.</li></ul></section><section><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Premier Academic Grade Printables</h2><p style=\"color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;\">Wizqo produces educator-approved resources that are free and instantly accessible. Our kindergarten reading sheets are high-resolution for professional visual guides and follow standard pedagogical development paths for early childhood literacy. Every download includes a clear guide for parents. Start your reading journey today!</p></section></article>"
